; claude: JSON read (Json), for configuration files (tinybox's
; .codemapconfig), over JavaScript's lexer (Js_lexer): only the grammar
; is here. jsonnet, JSON's superset, is languages/jsonnet/ (with a lexer
; of its own: # comments, text blocks), whose values are manifested as
; this module's Json.t.
;
; Pure OCaml, no Playground (languages/README.md). A private
; library, installed as part of elm_playground.
(library
 (name lang_json)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries javascript))
